  "Metadata": {
    "Summary": "Generate and edit animations for any s&box model from text - UniMate built into a native animation editor, pure C#.",
    "Description": "Text to Animation turns prompts like \"walk cautiously forward, look behind, then run\" into real, compiled s&box animations for your own models, and gives you a clip editor to trim, loop, fix root motion and pose bones before saving straight back into the vmdl.\n\nEverything runs inside the editor in pure C# - no Python, no external tools. The UniMate model is downloaded once with one click.",
